hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"155","On the authority of Muhammad ibn Rafi’, on the authority of Abdul Razzaq, Malik informed us, on the authority of Amr ibn Yahya, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Abdullah ibn Zaid, that The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “wiped his head with his hands, and moved them forward and backward, starting with the front of his head, then moving them to the back of his head. Then he returned them until he returned to the place from which he started.”"
"156","On the authority of Saeed bin Abdul Rahman Al Makhzoumi, on the authority of Sufyan bin Uyaynah, on the authority of Amr bin Yahya Al Mazini, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Abdullah bin Zaid, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “performed ablution, washed his face three times, and washed his hands twice, then wiped his head, and began in advance, then he washed his feet.”"
